2026-10-23T09:00:38.4590640Z Commands:
2026-10-23T09:00:38.4591244Z   physical-pending    Inspect unresolved physical grants through the root helper (root only)
2026-10-23T09:00:38.4592352Z   physical-reconcile  Verify restored physical state and retire its grant record (root only; no USB writes)
